    # deadlocked first line never lets execution reach, so the countdown that gates
    # runVideoFrameTick's very first action can only ever be decremented by something
    # runVideoFrameTick itself is blocking. This patch breaks that cycle the direct
    # way: since musyxSynthFrame is a normal, non-recursive function (grepped its own
    # body -- no call, direct or indirect, back into waitForMusyXAudioTaskDone or
    # shutdownAudioEngine) and is the ONLY decrementer that exists anywhere in the
    # codebase, call it directly from inside the spin instead of blocking on a producer
