    # s139: rs_malloc universal-allocation log (Thread B, NEXT.md step 3).
    # Instruments rs_malloc itself rather than each of its ~40+ call sites
    # (per-call-site instrumenting was the s120/s122 pattern but doesn't
    # scale to "every allocation in the run"). Captures the requested size
    # (raw $a1/ctx->r5) and the caller's return address (raw $ra/ctx->r31)
