    # function's own internal osRecvMesg_recomp/osSendMesg_recomp calls or
    # register reuse, then logs both plus the returned pointer (ctx->r2,
    # set at the L_80001C74 epilogue from $s2/ctx->r18) right before the
    # single `return;`. Offline: sort [rs-malloc] lines by ptr, find which
    # [ptr, ptr+size) range contains the voice+0x34 corruption addresses
