    # ROGUESQ_LOG_RS_MALLOC_DIAG=1.
    # Events:
    #   fail     — any null return (rate-limit after 40)
    #   ok136c / fail136c — every size==0x136C
    #   posctrl  — first 8 successful flags==0 size>=0x800 (same-run positive control)
    # s625 walked with uint32 guest addrs in MEM_* → wrong phys (garbage maxfree even
    # on early success). s626: every node address goes through S32() before MEM_*.
