    # ("rnode" in that template) here is NOT a fresh argument -- it is
    # ITSELF an earlier, completely unguarded reload of the SAME 0x801163B0
    # free-list-cache-head global (`lui $a0,0x8011`/`lw $a0,0x63B0($a0)` at
    # 0x80010820/0x80010824, funcs_4.c), loaded into r4 and never reassigned
    # before DL_LIST_RESET_GUARD's own unconditional `MEM_W(0X0, ctx->r4) =
    # 0;` write at 0x80010880 -- 3 instructions before DL_LIST_RESET_GUARD's
