    # BETWEEN the load and this write varies site to site (4-24 lines of
    # unrelated intervening computation -- index arithmetic, unrelated
    # loads/stores, occasional branches/labels) so no single blanket regex
    # spans load-to-write here. Each site is instead patched by its own
